      "questionText": "What will be the output of the following pseudocode? Initial values: a = 4, b = 4, c = 7 Int fun(int a, int b, int c) { For (each c from 3 to 5) { a = (c + c) ^ b; If ((a + c) < (c + a)) { b = (a + 11) + c; } Else { c = b + b; a = 3 + b; continue; } } Return a + b; }",
      "questionHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">What will be the output of the following pseudocode?</span></strong><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Initial values:<br />a = 4, b = 4, c = 7<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Int fun(int a, int b, int c) {<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; For (each c from 3 to 5) {<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; a = (c + c) ^ b;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; If ((a + c) &lt; (c + a)) {<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; b = (a + 11) + c;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Else {<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; c = b + b;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; a = 3 + b;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; continue;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Return a + b;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">}</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
